Grow the stack in pattern_to_expr: an invalid deeply nested pattern (`case [[[...]]]():`)
recursed without stacker and overflowed the 1 MiB wasm stack.
Regression test included; fuzz repro: repro/fix-parser-pattern-to-expr-stack-overflow.py (ruff_parse_simple).

